  "description": "In-memory lexical cache indexer with optional PT-BR stemming (Porter), phonetic (Soundex PT-BR), synonym dictionary expansion and pluggable cache providers (in-memory, distributed Redis/Garnet, composite, persistence channel, topics and queues). Includes Background Service workers (PersistenceChannelWorker<T>, TopicQueueWorker<T>) + dispatchers (DataDispatcher<T>, TopicDispatcher<T>) for automatic replication to a DB via IPersistenceRepository<T>.",
  "iconFile": "cache-indexer-logo.png",
  "id": "Rochas.CacheIndexer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
