  "packageSize": 68549,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/rocha83/CacheIndexer",
  "published": "2026-09-24T03:00:01.98Z",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - ChannelAction.Update end-to-end (full entity + filter; load-modify-write like the repository). v1.2.0 - Flush barrier for the persistence channel (FlushAsync resolves when the last consumer drains, TimeoutException on expiry, barrier never reaches repositories); IChannelCacheProvider opt-in contract; 140 tests. v1.1.0 - Topics and queues over Garnet/Redis via ITopicQueueProvider (Publish/Subscribe/Enqueue/Dequeue reusing ChannelMessage): InMemoryTopicQueueProvider (local fan-out topics + p2p queues, no server) and DistributedTopicQueueProvider (pub/sub + LIST, same connection string serves Garnet and Redis, local-first with best-effort remote); TopicDispatcher<T>, TopicQueueWorker<T> (topic/queue BackgroundService) and TopicQueueConfig; 134 tests, 95.34% line coverage; fully backward-compatible, no Data.Specification bump.",
